      "value": "This has been an ongoing problem for a long time and there is a canny posted about it still being a problem and has gotten out of control due to people leaking the client so people can abuse it as much as possible or when someone blocks them or calls them edgy. It is really annoying and hoping it gets patched next update and not sitting 3-4 updates late.",
