      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name} You should make sure to NOT send any user IP addresses in any way within packets (not confirmed) over the network.\n\nAlso no floodable commands that could let someone with a modified client permanently kick someone without administrative permissions validated by server side. @{5c502aac192f4635b927f8fe|full_name} is right. A server side validation is required.\n\nIt should not be that hard to check if the user is admin before executing a command.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
