      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They also can kick anyone when have that modified client. I experienced this today - my friend just got kicked 2-3 min after he blocked a cheater, without even voting (no voting appeared at all), and cannot join that public world for hour or so. Cheater also can see peoples who blocked him - i heard, he is speaking of this. He says hes not only remain to see avatar after being blocked, but also see special flag on top of nametag of that person.\nDo something, or soon we all end up in private worlds...",
      "viewerReactions": null
